
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f9e5ec">
<title>Hey, You ♡</title>

<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  padding: 22px;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg,#fff8fa,#f7dce6,#fff9f7);
  color: #654453;
  font-family: Georgia,serif;
}

.panel {
  max-width: 650px;
  width: 100%;
  padding: clamp(28px,7vw,55px);
  text-align: center;
  background: #fffaf8e8;
  border: 1px solid #f0d4df;
  border-radius: 24px;
  box-shadow: 0 12px 35px #b66c8620;
  animation: fade .8s ease;
}

.small {
  font: 11px Arial,sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: .2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #b4778e;
}

h1 {
  font-size: clamp(38px,9vw,55px);
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: normal;
  color: #a34f70;
  margin: 22px 0;
}

.quote {
  font-size: clamp(19px,4vw,25px);
  line-height: 1.8;
  color: #a34f70;
}

p {
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.buttons {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-top: 30px;
}

button {
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 13px 25px;
  background: #a34f70;
  color: white;
  font: inherit;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.back {
  background: #d9a0b4;
}

@keyframes fade {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<main class="panel">

  <div class="small">A note before you begin</div>

  <h1>Hey, you.</h1>

  <p class="quote">
    I made something special for you. I hope you take your time
    exploring every little page of this website. ♡
  </p>

  <p>
    There's a little story I want to share with you.
  </p>

  <div class="buttons">
    <button class="back" onclick="location.href='index.html'">
      ← Back
    </button>

    <button onclick="location.href='page3.html'">
      Continue ♡ →
    </button>
  </div>

</main>

</body>
</html>
